    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d218">

                <pb facs="0285" n="275" sameAs="frus:frus1948v07/pg275"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/6–548: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Shanghai</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Pilcher</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-06-05T10:00:00+09:00">June 5, 1948—10 a.
                            m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received June 5—12:21 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1260. Large anti-American student parade to be attempted today. Mayor<anchor
                        n="91" xml:id="d218-f1"/> informs me he has ordered universities
                    participating to be <pb facs="0286" n="276" xml:id="pg276"/> surrounded by
                    cordons of police to prevent departure of students from campus and that
                    plain-clothes men are being detailed to Consulate offices and other centers of
                    American activities. Report received that students are preparing present
                    anti-American Japan aid petition to Consul General this afternoon. Consulate
                    General being officially closed, Mayor suggests that I do not appear.</p>
                <p>Sent Department, Nanking 1013.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Pilcher</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d218-f1" n="91" xml:id="d218-f1-content">
